366→   * Update the permission level of a share.
367→   * Only the sharer (owner) can upgrade or downgrade permission.
368→   * Upgrading to 'write' requires an ECIES-wrapped IPNS private key.
369→   * Downgrading to 'read' clears the IPNS key.
