  1→/**
  2→ * SharedFileBrowser -- File browser for shared content with conditional write support.
  3→ *
  4→ * Shows items shared with the current user at ~/shared.
  5→ * - Top-level: flat list of received shares with SHARED BY column
  6→ * - Inside folder: standard file list with [RW]/[RO] badges
  7→ * - Write shares: upload/mkdir toolbar, full context menu (rename, delete)
  8→ * - Read-only shares: no write actions, download/preview/details only
  9→ * - Drag-and-drop upload zone for write shares
